▶ /help          Show available slash commands
  /status        Show current session status
  /sandbox       Show sandbox isolation status
  /compact       Compact local session history
  /model         Show or switch the active model
  /permissions   Show or switch the active permission mode
  /clear         Start a fresh local session
  /cost          Show cumulative token usage for this sessio
  /resume        Load a saved session into the REPL
  /config        Inspect Claude config files or merged secti
  /mcp           Inspect configured MCP servers
  /browser       Attach to your Chrome
